{"success":true,"site":"tmdb","sid":"movie/637","tmdb_id":637,"title":"美丽人生","original_title":"La vita è bella","overview":"犹太青年圭多（罗伯托·贝尼尼 Roberto Benigni 饰）邂逅美丽的女教师多拉（尼可莱塔·布拉斯基 Nicoletta Braschi 饰），他彬彬有礼的向多拉鞠躬：“早安！公主！”。历经诸多令人啼笑皆非的周折后，天遂人愿，两人幸福美满的生活在一起。然而好景不长，法西斯政权下，圭多和儿子被强行送往犹太人集中营。多拉虽没有犹太血统，毅然同行，与丈夫儿子分开关押在一个集中营里。聪明乐天的圭多哄骗儿子这只是一场游戏，奖品就是一辆大坦克，儿子快乐、天真的生活在纳粹的阴霾之中。尽管集中营的生活艰苦寂寞，圭多仍然带给他人很多快乐，他还趁机在纳粹的广播里问候妻子：“早安！公主！”法西斯政权即将倾覆，纳粹的集中营很快就要接受最后的清理，圭多编给儿子的游戏该怎么结束？他们一家能否平安的度过这黑暗的年代呢？","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q5uZjTEq1CCDNJDkxzJkFtWGTAU.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6aNKD81RHR1DqUUa8kOZ1TBY1Lp.jpg","release_date":"1997-12-20","year":"1997","runtime":"116 minutes","tmdb_rating_average":8.438,"tmdb_votes":13979,"tmdb_rating":"8.438 / 10 from 13979 users","genres":["喜剧","剧情"],"languages":[],"countries":["Italy"],"production_companies":["Mario e Vittorio Cecchi Gori - C.E.I.A.D.","Melampo Cinematografica"],"directors":[{"name":"罗伯托·贝尼尼","id":4818}],"producers":[{"name":"Gianluigi Braschi","id":9232},{"name":"Elda Ferri","id":9233}],"cast":[{"id":4818,"name":"罗伯托·贝尼尼","original_name":"Roberto Benigni","character":"Guido","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/ba1Sg02XxCphu6E1dWDMAH1GzeE.jpg"},{"id":9235,"name":"尼可莱塔·布拉斯基","original_name":"Nicoletta Braschi","character":"Dora","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/9IeE3Iz9HXZVTrvhjSCKlR4FLxB.jpg"},{"id":9236,"name":"乔治·坎塔里尼","original_name":"Giorgio Cantarini","character":"Giosué","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/1tKZHpVTYcw8EP3naVTZFlrOkhQ.jpg"},{"id":9237,"name":"朱斯蒂诺·杜拉诺","original_name":"Giustino Durano","character":"Zio","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/5VbG50qZNUnpx6UW7594RUlX7SZ.jpg"},{"id":9239,"name":"赛尔乔·比尼·布斯特里克","original_name":"Sergio Bini Bustric","character":"Ferruccio","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/crnlLn1SxP2LqbsXNr8CQrvaiNc.jpg"},{"id":954,"